Character Design

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:13.630
Sub-character Design

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:13.630
Asano Kyoji

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:13.630
Director of Photography

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:13.630
Sasagawa Keisuke

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:23.680
I think I'll break up with my boyfriend today.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.400
It's never worked out with any of my previous boyfriends, either.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:59.180
Art Director

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:59.180
Kobayashi Shichiro

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:59.180
Color Design

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:59.180
Hirose Izumi

00:01:54.590 --> 00:02:00.140
I am the one who once hurt someone very dear to my boyfriend.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:31.500
Satou Atsushi

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:31.500
Special Effects

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:31.500
Murakami Masahiro

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:31.420
I once had a relationship end with my boyfriend
suddenly getting up and running away.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:15.590
I got very drunk once. When I came to,
my boyfriend was nowhere to be seen.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:19.930
Whenever I'm on the verge of love, I always screw it up.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:20.800
Supervisor of Photography

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:20.800
Ishiguro Seiji

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:20.800
Editing

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:20.800
Hamauzu Taeko

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:24.550
It always backfires when I try to do something for my boyfriend.

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:30.400
Chizuru, you know, you never change.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:31.690
Now, that's not true—

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:34.690
Have you ever really been loved?

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:39.400
No matter how deep in love you are, it's a two-way street.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:45.540
My current boyfriend is Yuudai-kun.

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:50.170
I've told him I love him many times, but he's never said it back.

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:53.880
I don't want to continue an unrequited love.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:58.220
That's why I plan to have a really memorable date today, and then end it.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:02.680
I don't want to feel this way any more.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:10.310
Sound Director

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:10.310
Ebina Yasunori

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:10.310
Music

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:00.070
I'm leaving now.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.320
Take care!

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:05.280
Oh, don't we look stylish today!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.490
A date? Don't be late!

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.210
Okay.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:16.750
Director

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:16.750
Shiotani Naoyoshi

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.080
Sorry I'm late.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:54.870
Don't worry about it.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:59.710
Oh, that's right... How's your knee?

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:03.840
You tripped on your way out of the house, didn't you?

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:06.170
Huh? How do you know that?

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:09.220
I know everything about you, Yuudai-kun.

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.980
Wow, incredible.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:16.060
I always watch you, even before our dates.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:18.310
Your outfit really suits you today.

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:19.520
You think so?

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.110
Thanks.

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.710
Yuudai-kun...

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.030
For me...

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:31.060
You're pretty stylish yourself, Yuudai-kun.

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:32.290
You look good.

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:33.830
Yeah, I guess.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.210
I thought so, too.

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:39.710
What I want isn't a present. Don't you understand?

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:41.000
Oh yeah.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:43.050
This is for you.

00:06:44.010 --> 00:06:44.880
Thank you!

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:47.890
Sorry.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.260
Hello?

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:53.390
Hello?

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.480
My connection is lousy...

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:16.500
Wh-What's this?

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.240
H-Hey!

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.420
Wait!

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.380
Wait up!

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:01.010
My cell phone!

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:02.470
It's gone! Gone!

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.230
What should I do?

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:07.900
Huh?

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.850
Wh-What?

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:15.870
Stay back.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:19.580
Oh yeah.

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:23.080
It's not wet. Thank goodness.

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:28.340
I have to give this to him. Today's our last day together.

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:30.880
What is it?

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.130
My cell phone?!

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:34.550
Thank you.

00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:37.220
Excuse me.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:40.310
That belongs to me.

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:44.350
Sorry about that.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:53.730
Whee!

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:01.830
I don't want to end it like this.

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:09.620
Where'd that come from?

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.590
Hey, hey...

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.140
Come on.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.640
There, there...

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:24.600
What? No way!

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:27.730
Wait!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.240
Ow-ow-ow-ow-ow!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.450
You're gonna hurt someone like that!

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.330
I'm terribly sorry!

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.030
Just watch where you're going.

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.250
It's gone.

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:53.760
Oh yeah.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.420
Yuudai-kun...

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:59.420
Hey, I'm leaving.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.310
Hey!

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:04.560
What's wrong?

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:20.920
He's gone.

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:24.780
That's it!

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:32.670
Send

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:33.170
Check Mail

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:33.170
Inbox

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:33.170
To

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:33.170
Title

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:32.710
Send

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:34.460
The inputted address does not exist

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:34.460
Go back to SEAMO Mail

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.420
The inputted address does not exist

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.420
Go back to SEAMO Mail

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:41.420
Huh?

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:46.350
I don't know my boyfriend's email address.

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.390
Miss...

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:50.400
Your companion is...

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:58.900
I apologize.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.670
This sucks.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.420
Why did it have to happen like this?

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:17.420
Why are you here?

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.010
I guess I'm the one who brought you here.

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:25.390
My favorite bag got soaked, and I lost my cell phone.

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:28.390
And Yuudai-kun gave me this weird animal.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:32.900
I wonder if he knows what sort of day I'm having.

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:35.940
I suppose he'd have no way of knowing.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:44.600
Yes, may I ask who's calling?

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:47.580
I'm Yamada, the guy who talked to you before.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.410
I found your cell phone.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.710
Thank you so much.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.460
It wasn't a big deal.

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:58.630
I hope having to head back home didn't inconvenience you.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:12:59.920
You had to stay in your room...

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:06.330
But I didn't know what time I was getting off work,
and it would've been tough to wait outside.

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:08.770
I know, I'm sorry for all the trouble.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:13.150
Man, I'm thirsty.

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:14.600
Could I have something to drink?

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:16.060
Umm...

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.110
Can I step in?

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.780
Entering!

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:26.330
He's really going to be like that no matter what...

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:34.330
I'm gonna head home.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.330
I see.

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:40.420
By the way, I got a phone call from your boyfriend today.

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:42.220
He's worried sick.

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:44.720
See you!

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:49.140
Thank you.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.320
You have a new message.

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:58.450
Sorry, there was a mix-up and it looks
like the box had a mini-donkey in it.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:59.850
So you're a mini-donkey.

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:04.380
If you can... Where are you? Sorry, please call—

00:14:05.520 --> 00:14:07.870
I'm not sure what to do about him.

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:10.280
He's indecisive and a real coward.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.040
Plus he's not very bright.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:15.830
You're much more dependable.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:19.790
In any case, you don't understand a word I'm saying.

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:21.380
But...

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:23.750
Stop that!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.340
Stop, it tickles!

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:29.340
But he...

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:42.940
Here's your consolation prize.

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:55.870
Here, use this instead.

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:58.710
Thank you!

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:05.550
I love you.

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:09.300
But I'm worried about things.

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:21.270
We'll meet up again tomorrow and I'll make up my mind about us.

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:38.580
You have to behave so we can surprise Yuudai-kun.

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:42.320
Here goes.

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:45.630
That's Yuudai-kun's ringtone...

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:53.390
Huh?

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:58.480
Chizuru-chan!

00:15:58.480 --> 00:15:59.850
Good morning!

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:01.270
Sorry about yesterday.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.910
Yeah, I was worried.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:06.300
I dropped my phone and couldn't get ahold of you.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:07.440
Oh yeah!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:10.910
There was a miniature donkey in that box, right?

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:12.630
Yeah, there was!

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:13.660
I see.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:20.870
It was a mix-up. It didn't bite you, did it?

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:22.420
I'm fine.

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.050
Great.

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:28.630
Is something wrong?

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:31.890
Who is she?

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:35.320
I'm Miki!

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:38.650
Well, you see, she's...

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:41.270
What's the meaning of this?

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:45.140
What's... the meaning of this?

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:49.570
Weren't you with a man last night?

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:51.950
Was I?

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:57.780
And you two were making fun of me, right?

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:59.580
It was a man, wasn't it?

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.210
That's it.

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:05.170
It always turns out like this.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.130
It was.

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:10.220
See you.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:18.930
Have you ever really been loved?

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:31.860
Thank you.

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:39.660
Excuse me, may I leave work early today?

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:43.070
To ask such a thing all of a sudden...

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:44.670
Did something happen?

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.210
Sure. Take the rest of the day off!

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:51.010
Thank you.

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:54.340
Can you just take care of that one table?

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:55.050
Sure.

00:17:58.530 --> 00:17:59.810
The mini-donkey!

00:18:06.110 --> 00:18:09.530
What? You stayed at your ex-boyfriend's place?

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:13.970
Nah, he's not my ex-boyfriend.

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:15.830
Just a friend. A friend!

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:16.820
Really?

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.490
Really, really!

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:21.200
He's got some girl he's dating.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:23.830
I guess he's having trouble telling her how he feels.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.460
He's totally in love, too.

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:28.880
I should say it, too. Ken-chan, I love you!

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:30.590
I love you too, Miki.

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:32.130
Yay!

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:39.560
That's odd.

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:51.010
Isn't that the one from yesterday?

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:52.940
The present is missing!

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:02.290
The mini-donkey? What's he doing up there?

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.490
Does that mean Yuudai-kun is...

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:09.210
He's afraid of heights!

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.760
Excuse me, please take me to Tokyo Tower.

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:21.140
Driver, please hurry.

00:19:35.990 --> 00:19:37.530
Yuudai-kun!

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:39.990
What is he doing?

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:47.410
Yuudai-kun!

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:53.670
Be careful, it's dangerous!

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:13.520
You can make it! Just a little farther!

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:15.570
That's dangerous!

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.900
Just stay there!

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:20.280
Yuudai-kun...

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:21.950
Sorry.

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:23.980
I tried to end things on my own.

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.030
I'm the worst.

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:30.960
Chizuru!

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:41.300
Yuudai-kun?

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:43.970
Yuudai-kun!

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:47.680
Hey! Are you two okay?!

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:00.320
What is it?

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.520
Mini-donkey...

00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:07.800
Isn't that... Yuudai-kun's present?

00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:10.660
You found it for me.

00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:16.210
Hey! It's dangerous. Please come over here.

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:39.660
I'm always thinking of you.

00:21:41.720 --> 00:21:46.360
At work, at home... I can't help myself.

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:51.090
I get so uneasy.

00:21:54.720 --> 00:21:56.960
I want to be with you forever.

00:21:58.530 --> 00:21:59.380
But...

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:06.140
I'm not the person you think I am.

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:20.150
Back then, you and I shined together.

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:22.480
I thought our love would last forever.

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:24.960
You are no longer beside me.

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:27.140
And I'm no longer with you.

00:22:27.140 --> 00:22:31.570
I look into your eyes as you cry hysterically

00:22:31.890 --> 00:22:36.270
as I hold onto your hands.

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:42.120
As soon as we let go, we'll never see each other again.

00:22:42.310 --> 00:22:44.540
But I want to end this with a smile, so I say:

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:46.890
Let's meet again, let's meet again.

00:22:47.150 --> 00:22:49.320
I act so strong and friendly when I'm with you.

00:22:49.640 --> 00:22:51.720
And I definitely wanted you to depend on me.

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:55.100
Yuudai-kun

00:22:51.940 --> 00:22:54.040
I act like I'm strong and hate to lose.

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:56.480
I can't even tell you the truth at the very end.

00:22:56.530 --> 00:22:58.520
I've cried because of your words.

00:22:58.860 --> 00:23:00.850
I'm encouraged by your words.

00:23:01.310 --> 00:23:03.330
And I'm about to turn the magic of your words

00:23:03.330 --> 00:23:05.680
into a nice memory and disappear.

00:23:05.680 --> 00:23:08.540
But I can't forgive you for hurting me,

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:10.930
so "thank you" is all I can say.

00:23:10.930 --> 00:23:12.890
I wasn't planning on ending up with you.

00:23:12.890 --> 00:23:15.400
I just found myself suddenly in your sweetness.

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:17.820
You're not that strong.

00:23:18.110 --> 00:23:20.490
Have you been putting off the sadness?

00:23:20.490 --> 00:23:22.780
You can cry, it's cool, I'm gonna cry too.

00:23:22.780 --> 00:23:25.310
But God, please, forgive me for today.

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:31.520
I look into your eyes as you cry hysterically

00:23:31.910 --> 00:23:36.270
as I hold onto your hands.

00:23:36.670 --> 00:23:42.130
As soon as we let go, we'll never see each other again.

00:23:42.310 --> 00:23:44.490
But I want to end this with a smile, so I say:

00:23:44.490 --> 00:23:46.880
Let's meet again, let's meet again.

00:23:46.880 --> 00:23:48.920
You've been loved by others.

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:51.310
You're always going to be dazzling.

00:23:51.310 --> 00:23:54.190
That's why I get jealous, fight and cry.

00:23:54.280 --> 00:23:56.530
I just can't do this anymore.

00:23:56.530 --> 00:23:58.940
We're going to fall in love with other people.

00:23:58.940 --> 00:24:01.310
We're going to live our own lives.

00:24:01.530 --> 00:24:03.810
I was truly happy with you.

00:24:03.810 --> 00:24:06.110
I was truly happy, too.

00:24:06.110 --> 00:24:08.470
You're going to disappear from my heart eventually, I think.

00:24:08.690 --> 00:24:11.020
That's why I want to keep it as wonderful memories.

00:24:11.250 --> 00:24:13.540
Looking back, I'll be able to be proud of our love in the future.

00:24:13.540 --> 00:24:15.740
My tear-filled smile will turn into a new day.

00:24:15.940 --> 00:24:18.000
That's why I'm going to end it right here.

00:24:18.000 --> 00:24:20.830
You'll come to understand why we can't meet again.

00:25:01.110 --> 00:25:04.930
I want to keep our emotions as simple as possible.

00:25:05.550 --> 00:25:11.190
But on the flip side, we have to treasure these feelings.

00:25:11.190 --> 00:25:14.570
Until everything's in order, I just have to tell myself:

00:25:14.870 --> 00:25:17.720
We can't see each other. We can't be near each other.

00:25:17.720 --> 00:25:20.100
Just thoughts, hard to forget thoughts...

00:25:22.080 --> 00:25:26.500
I cherish the days we spent together.

00:25:26.870 --> 00:25:31.300
You softly wrapped yourself around me.

00:25:31.660 --> 00:25:37.090
But, after tonight, we'll never see each other again.

00:25:37.220 --> 00:25:40.630
So I say, even if we're born again, let's meet up again.

00:25:41.290 --> 00:25:45.730
I look into your eyes as you cry hysterically

00:25:46.050 --> 00:25:50.470
as I hold onto your hands.

00:25:50.810 --> 00:25:56.260
As soon as we let go, we'll never see each other again.

00:25:56.430 --> 00:25:58.660
But I want to end this with a smile, so I say:

00:25:58.660 --> 00:26:00.980
Let's meet again, let's meet again.

00:26:02.890 --> 00:26:03.440
Yeah

00:26:04.770 --> 00:26:05.890
You and I...

00:26:10.680 --> 00:26:12.620
Sure, we had a sad breakup.

00:26:13.070 --> 00:26:15.050
But we can look back and laugh at the good times.

00:26:15.440 --> 00:26:17.750
I've come to accept this inescapable reality.

00:26:17.870 --> 00:26:20.300
But of course I'm glad I met you.
